<!-- /wp:paragraph -->
<!-- wp:wdl/paid-block-content-7 {"pcColumns":"3","fontColorLi":"#33221a","fontWeightLi":"600","titleFontSizeClass":"font_size_m","fontColorLiP":"#332b26","textFontSizeClass":"font_size_s","borderColor":"#e8e0d8","borderSize":1,"imageBorderRadius":12,"titleTag":"h3","titleBorderRadius":0,"titleBorderColor":"#5c3d2e","titleBorderSize":4} -->
<div class="wp-block-wdl-paid-block-content-7 paid-block-content-7"><ul class="paid-block-content-7__inner"><li class="paid-block-content-7__li"><div class="link"><div class="image" style="border-radius:12px;border-color:#e8e0d8;border-width:1px;border-style:solid"><img src="https://liteword-assets.bigi-ishikawa.workers.dev/t/sec/cf_use_01.webp" alt=""/><h3 class="ttl font_size_m" data-lw_font_set="" style="font-weight:600;color:#33221a;border-radius:0px;border-bottom-color:#5c3d2e;border-bottom-width:4px;border-bottom-style:solid">マグ1つで</h3></div><p class="paid-block-content-7__text font_size_s" data-lw_font_set="" style="font-weight:400;color:#332b26">粉をマグに入れて、お湯を注いで4分待ち、上澄みを飲むだけ。道具はマグとスプーンだけで足ります。ざらつきが気になる方は茶こしを1枚。</p></div></li><li class="paid-block-content-7__li"><div class="link"><div class="image" style="border-radius:12px;border-color:#e8e0d8;border-width:1px;border-style:solid"><img src="https://liteword-assets.bigi-ishikawa.workers.dev/t/sec/cf_use_02.webp" alt=""/><h3 class="ttl font_size_m" data-lw_font_set="" style="font-weight:600;color:#33221a;border-radius:0px;border-bottom-color:#5c3d2e;border-bottom-width:4px;border-bottom-style:solid">氷で急冷して</h3></div><p class="paid-block-content-7__text font_size_s" data-lw_font_set="" style="font-weight:400;color:#332b26">濃いめに淹れて、氷をいっぱいに入れたグラスへ一気に注ぐだけ。浅煎りのものがいちばん向きます。夏はこの飲み方が多いです。</p></div></li><li class="paid-block-content-7__li"><div class="link"><div class="image" style="border-radius:12px;border-color:#e8e0d8;border-width:1px;border-style:solid"><img src="https://liteword-assets.bigi-ishikawa.workers.dev/t/sec/cf_use_03.webp" alt=""/><h3 class="ttl font_size_m" data-lw_font_set="" style="font-weight:600;color:#33221a;border-radius:0px;border-bottom-color:#5c3d2e;border-bottom-width:4px;border-bottom-style:solid">牛乳で割って</h3></div><p class="paid-block-content-7__text font_size_s" data-lw_font_set="" style="font-weight:400;color:#332b26">深煎りは牛乳に負けません。粉を倍にして淹れ、同じ量の温めた牛乳を足すと、お店のカフェオレに近くなります。</p></div></li></ul></div>
